{"4701040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arms Dealer Simulator", "steam_appid": 4701040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arms Dealer Simulator is a simulation game, where you manage a massive arms distribution empire and everything from assembly lines to logistic operations.You pick contracts and prepare orders by buying necessary weapons, parts and ammunition. You will be building guns, organizing and packaging massive amounts of weaponry and delivering them with your own scalable logistics fleet to grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/86c2145e045dfc6146808cf95046a534.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/86c2145e045dfc6146808cf95046a534.webm?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/86c2145e045dfc6146808cf95046a534.mp4?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply and demand are the heart of your business. Place your orders and monitor the arrival of fresh stock as crates and components roll into your facility through the automated delivery system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/80407def33e32c34aa779345e6b7f600.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/80407def33e32c34aa779345e6b7f600.webm?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/80407def33e32c34aa779345e6b7f600.mp4?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workshop is where the magic happens. Roll up your sleeves and engage in the process of crafting weapons, transforming loose parts into a finished product that’s ready for the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/661fbabc32b0631700e4af181095db7d.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/661fbabc32b0631700e4af181095db7d.webm?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/661fbabc32b0631700e4af181095db7d.mp4?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cluttered workspace leads to a slow delivery. Master the art of inventory management by neatly sorting your stock and optimizing your storage chests for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/7c68cafc699e050166e73a4995fed4a4.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/7c68cafc699e050166e73a4995fed4a4.webm?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/7c68cafc699e050166e73a4995fed4a4.mp4?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final step before the hand-off is ensuring everything is packed tight. Close the lids on your fully stocked crates and double-check that your inventory is locked, loaded, and ready to ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/fc4f5bbcda0fc7023738fae73780f748.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/fc4f5bbcda0fc7023738fae73780f748.webm?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/fc4f5bbcda0fc7023738fae73780f748.mp4?t=1778832278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heavy work is done; now comes the payoff. Dispatch your fleet of trucks across the world to complete your contracts and watch your empire grow with every successful delivery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arms Dealer Simulator is a simulation game, where you manage a massive arms distribution empire and everything from assembly lines to logistic operations.You pick contracts and prepare orders by buying necessary weapons, parts and ammunition. You will be building guns, organizing and packaging massive amounts of weaponry and delivering them with your own scalable logistics fleet to grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/86c2145e045dfc6146808cf95046a534.poster.avif?t=1778832278\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701040/extras/86c2145e045dfc6146808cf95046a534.webm?